{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Research record (spec enumerations, part 1 of 2: sections (1) and (3); part 2 carries (4)–(7); section (2), the twin-pair list, is posted as the first comment of the held-out epic traitorous-official-sunbittern). All findings are based on `origin/main` @ `083620b0` (fetched 2026-09-07).\n\n## Enumerations\n\n### (1) Seam/split guards NOT in the prior 13 (24 files, 4,795 LOC, 383 collected nodes)\n\n| # | file (LOC / nodes) | what it pins | verdict |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/fetch/test_fetcher_split_jql_queries.py` (191/3) | bug `f6cc-b174-9e9a-435c` split-JQL behaviour | KEEP — not a split guard |\n| 2 | `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_access_check_client_seam.py` (132/3) | bug `2c4b` call-time client binding | KEEP |\n| 3 | `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_fetch_paging_split.py` (83/5) | fetcher→fetch_paging re-export identity, one-way import, ≤650 LOC; paging drain = `fetch/test_fetcher_pagination_jql.py:156`, ceiling = `fetch/test_fetcher_truncation_gate.py:116` | DELETE-WHOLE |\n| 4 | `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_jira_family_seam.py` (150/14) | shared-layer public-surface behaviour | KEEP |\n| 5 | `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler/test_rich_text_seam_heldout.py` (270/10) | 4 codec-composition behaviour tests, 3 layering scans, 1 prose grep | KEEP; delete `test_cloud_send_path_prose_names_shared_codec_owner` (:35-42); rename → `test_rich_text_seam.py` (unpaired held-out) |\n| 6 | `tests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py` (359/15) | 12 behaviour + §C floor/leaf/inline-literal (:311-359) | DELETE-BUT-MOVE: `git mv` → `tests/unit/test_agent_call.py`; drop `test_agent_call_clears_the_split_floor`, `test_agent_call_has_no_runtime_import_from_runner`, `test_runn