nding, co-location; ids frozen at `tests/interfaces/store/test_ensures.py:56` | DELETE-WHOLE |\n| 14 | `tests/unit/test_interpret_failure_seam.py` (249/16) | except-spine behaviour | KEEP |\n| 15 | `tests/unit/test_opcert_producer_seam_8d8e.py` (558/24) | op-cert signing behaviour | KEEP |\n| 16 | `tests/unit/test_oracle_grade_split.py` (152/5) | grade behaviour | KEEP |\n| 17 | `tests/unit/test_plan_review_workflow_ops_seam.py` (141/2) | registry completeness + gate-YAML `uses` resolution (subprocess) | KEEP — a registration contract, not a split pin |\n| 18 | `tests/unit/test_processors_status_split.py` (111/5) | identity, package shim, one-way, ≤650 | DELETE-BUT-MOVE: `test_status_fold_replay_equivalence` + `_apply_status` → `tests/unit/test_plan_review_phase_reducer.py` (imports `process_status` at `:10`; no name clash with `_status` at `:14`) |\n| 19 | `tests/unit/test_prompt_cache_split.py` (215/15) | stable/volatile prompt feature | KEEP |\n| 20 | `tests/unit/test_prompt_model_module_seam.py` (142/28) | defining module, re-export identity, leaf, size band | DELETE-WHOLE |\n| 21 | `tests/unit/test_prompt_repo_root_seam.py` (313/15) | bug `dc05` behaviour | KEEP |\n| 22 | `tests/unit/test_settings_builders_seam.py` (289/16) | builder behaviour | KEEP |\n| 23 | `tests/unit/test_signing_module_split.py` (178/57) | 48 re-export/`__all__` nodes, leaf/direction, headroom/stub sizes, 2 patch-observed tests; baked fallback = `tests/unit/test_attestation_signing.py:152`; the `_signing_hmac` patch test dies with the HMAC epic | DELETE-WHOLE |\n| 24 | `tests/unit/test_structured_run_seam.py` (146/6) | exists/floor/leaf/moved/no-copy; lean import = `tests/interfaces/store/test_llm_optionality.py:89` (`rebar.llm` param) | DELETE-WHOLE |\n\nNode arithmetic for S1 over all 37 files (486 nodes) + `tests/scripts/test_residual_drain_happy.py` (3): **301 deleted, 39 moved, 149 kept** (12 kept files unchanged = 128; `test_agent_call` 12; `test_rich_text_seam` 9).\n\n### (3) `scripts/check_*.py` single-owner table (33 scripts)\n\n`make lint` (`Makefile:266-439`) runs in CI via `_build-and-test.yml:102`, so a lint-wired script has one owner. Delete = \"real tree is clean\" / \"make lint wires it\" twins (74 collected nodes total); keep = fixture tests on synthetic input.\n\n| script | owner | pytest twin (LOC) | delete | keep |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| check_adr_numbers | docs-gates action `:22` → ADD to `make lint` | `tests/scripts/test_check_adr_numbers{,_heldout}.py` (104+185) | heldout: `test_ci_wires_the_gate`, `test_real_repo_tree_is_clean`, `test_real_tree_has_no_duplicate_numbers`, `test_real_tree_marker_per_adr`, `test_real_check_script_runs_as_subprocess` | all 14 `_valid_tree`/tmp_path tests |\n| check_build_env_locked | `release.yml:184` | `tests/unit/test_check_build_env_locked.py` (128) | — | all 7 |\n| check_cli_json_js_safe | lint `:367` | `test_cli_json_js_safe_guard.py` (246) | `test_the_repository_is_clean`, `test_make_lint_invokes_the_gate` | 11 |\n| check_comment_hygiene | lint `:315` | `test_comment_hygiene_guard.py` (327) | `test_the_real_tree_is_clean` (repo_policy `:267`), `test_make_lint_wires_the_hygiene_gate`, `test_wiring_check_detects_a_removed_invocation` | 20 |\n| check_commit_message_wrap | pre-commit `:78-80` | `test_check_commit_message_wrap.py` (223) | — | all 20 |\n| check_complexity_baseline | lint `:273` | `test_complexity_baseline.py` (1067), `_lock_47e9.py` (181) | `test_raw_json_census_exits_1_with_live_count`, `test_census_transport_exit_zero_same_count`, `test_wrapper_check_on_committed_baseline`, `test_committed_baseline_schema_and_count`, `test_committed_baseline_loads_and_checks_clean`, `test_make_lint_wires_wrapper_and_retains_ruff_format` | rest, incl. `test_src_rebar_has_no_inline_c901_noqa` (the script has no noqa scan) |\n| check_config_ownership | lint `:291` | `tests/scripts/test_check_config_ownership{,_heldout}.py` (100+272); `tests/unit/test_config_gate_wiring_heldout.py` (109) | heldo